// Claude Desktop config snippet — Unterm MCP server.
//
// PREREQUISITE: install the Unterm desktop app first (it carries the
// `unterm-cli` binary this snippet invokes). Download for your OS:
//
//     https://unterm.app/api/download
//
// (macOS .dmg / Linux .deb + .AppImage / Windows .msi + .zip — Apple-
//  notarized, MIT, $0.) Open Unterm once after install so the MCP server
// boots and writes ~/.unterm/active.json with the port + auth token; the
// stdio bridge below picks them up transparently.
//
// File to paste this into:
//   macOS:    ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json
//   Windows:  %APPDATA%\Claude\claude_desktop_config.json
//   Linux:    ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json
//
// Restart Claude Desktop after editing. Claude will then have 67 methods to
// drive your terminal (spawn panes, type into them, read scrollback, etc.).
// Discover the full surface by asking Claude to call `meta.surface`.

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "unterm": {
      "command": "unterm-cli",
      "args": ["mcp-stdio"]
    }
  }
}
